@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title 每日结算时序（每 600 秒一个游戏日）

participant "FxGameClock" as CLK
participant "GameManager" as GM
participant "BuildingManager" as BM
participant "ResourceManager" as RM
participant "RecipeRegistry" as RR
participant "EventManager" as EM
participant "People" as PP
participant "GameUiBridge" as UI
participant "MainView" as MV

CLK -> CLK : Timeline 到点（FX 线程）
CLK -> GM : onTick（提交到 daily-settlement 线程）
GM -> GM : eventDialogShowing ? 是 → 本轮跳过
GM -> BM : handle()
BM -> BM : 各建筑 handle() 收集产出/消耗\n按工人效率 × 等级 × 科技 × 饥饿倍率
BM -> RM : addResource / removeResource
RM --> BM : NotEnoughResources → 自动阻断消耗建筑
GM -> RR : processAll()
RR -> RM : 已解锁配方转化
GM -> EM : checkAndTrigger()（无弹窗且未结束）
EM --> GM : 选中事件 → setPendingEvent
GM -> UI : showEvent（回到 FX 线程弹窗）
GM -> GM : dayCounter++，每 10 天 recordHistory()
GM -> PP : updateFatigue() → advanceDay()
GM -> GM : checkFoodAndApplyHunger()（饥饿 Debuff）
GM -> UI : showWarning（食物归零时，按日节流）
GM -> UI : dispatch(notifyListener)
UI -> MV : update() 刷新资源栏/地图/图表
@enduml
